# QA + Proof (DoD) — REQUIRED
**Status:** REQUIRED — a PR is not accepted without these proofs.

---

## A) Alignment Proof (Container)
### Manual checks
- Compare left edge of:
  - nav links
  - section titles
  - card grids
They must align on:
- mobile
- tablet
- desktop

---

## B) Overflow Proof (No Horizontal Scroll)
### DevTools console script (required)
```js
const offenders = [...document.querySelectorAll("*")]
  .filter(el => el.scrollWidth > el.clientWidth)
  .map(el => ({
    el,
    scrollWidth: el.scrollWidth,
    clientWidth: el.clientWidth,
    className: el.className
  }));

console.table(offenders.map(o => ({
  scrollWidth: o.scrollWidth,
  clientWidth: o.clientWidth,
  className: (o.className || "").toString().slice(0, 120)
})));

offenders;
